<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Renal Treatment started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Renal Treatment started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Renal Treatment Centers Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Renal Treatment gained 3/4 to 26-1/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
